id: mojo-address-typing
section: Keyboard and text
item: Mojo: a search typed in the address bar on the keyboard replaces the selected address and Enter opens the search results
shells: mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-card-events.html
kit: cavekit-mojo-ui.md R6
needs: internet
calibrate bar
chrome address
expect keyboard up 8
type-keys webos
chrome kb-enter
wait load 60
expect url duckduckgo
